+//according to openai Codex:
+// in kotlin, val a: ()->B  wraps a B.  in lambda calculus which is left identity ?  in kotlin, a: ()->B  is right identity.  left identity is: val a: ()->B = { b }  right identity is:  val a: ()->B = b
