# 2025-05-24 04:24:56.718648
+Okay, this is a very detailed and ambitious design document. The Maven error you're seeing is a classic multi-module setup problem: `Non-resolvable parent POM: ... parent could not be found in reactor`. This means Maven tried to build `bikeshed` directly, but it didn't know about `dsel-bbcursive-parent` as the root of a multi-module project.
+
+To fix this, we need to create the `dsel-bbcursive-parent` POM at the root level, and declare `bbcursive` and `bikeshed` as its modules. Then, when you run `mvn clean install` from the `dsel-bbcursive-parent` directory, Maven will build the parent and then its modules in the correct order (`bbcursive` first, then `bikeshed` because `bikeshed` depends on `bbcursive`).
+
+Let's set up the project structure and implement the core DSEL components based on your excellent design principles.
+
+**Project Structure:**
+
+```
+dsel-bbcursive-parent/
+├── pom.xml                   <-- Root POM for the multi-module project
+├── bbcursive/
+│   ├── pom.xml               <-- bbcursive module POM
+│   └── src/main/java/com/yourdomain/bbcursive/
+│       ├── core/
+│       │   ├── Cursive.java
+│       │   └── ParseResult.java
+│       └── ops/
+│           ├── BBAtom.java
+│           └── BBCombinator.java
+│       └── util/
+│           └── ByteBufferUtils.java
+├── bikeshed/
+│   ├── pom.xml               <-- bikeshed module POM
+│   └── src/main/java/com/yourdomain/bikeshed/
+│       ├── core/
+│       │   ├── Join.java
+│       │   ├── Series.java
+│       │   ├── RowVec.java
+│       │   ├── Cursor.java
+│       │   └── Twin.java
+│       ├── dsel/
+│       │   └── D.java          <-- Omnibus DSEL operations
+│       ├── type/
+│       │   ├── ColumnMeta.java
+│       │   └── TypeMemento.java
+│       ├── io/
+│       │   ├── IOMemento.java
+│       │   ├── IsamDataFile.java
+│       │   └── IsamMetaFileReader.java
+│       └── trading/
+│           ├── AgentInterface.java
+│           ├── MarketDataSource.java
+│           └── MarketTick.java
+```
+
