+### Core DSEL Java Files (`bikeshed` module)
+
+I will implement the `Join`, `Series`, `MutableSeries`, `VersionedSeries`, `CowSeriesHandle`, `Series2`, `Twin` interfaces and `D` enum in `bikeshed/src/main/java/com/yourdomain/bikeshed/core`. I will also include the necessary `ByteBuffer` interfaces and utilities in `bbcursive`.
